<!-- pages/votedetail/votedetail.wxml —— 投票详情 / 投票·改票 / 结果 / 管理（契约 web/vote/CONTRACT.md §4.2） -->
<page-meta page-style="{{themeStyle}}"></page-meta>

<view class="page pad-action vd-page {{themeClass}}">

  <block wx:if="{{state === 'denied'}}">
    <view class="m3-card m3-card--outlined">
      <empty-state icon="🗳" title="需要班级身份" text="完成学号 + 姓名验证后即可查看和参与投票。" action-text="返回工具" bind:action="goAll"></empty-state>
    </view>
  </block>

  <block wx:elif="{{state === 'loading'}}">
    <view class="vd-sk">
      <view class="sk sk-title sk-shimmer"></view>
      <view class="sk sk-line sk-shimmer" style="width: 60%"></view>
      <view class="sk sk-card sk-shimmer"></view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <block wx:elif="{{state === 'error'}}">
    <view class="m3-card m3-card--outlined">
      <empty-state icon="🗳" title="投票加载失败" text="{{errorText}}" action-text="重试" bind:action="retryLoad"></empty-state>
    </view>
  </block>

  <block wx:elif="{{d}}">
    <!-- 顶部：状态 + 倒计时 + 标题 -->
    <view class="vd-hero">
      <view class="vd-hero-hd">
        <text class="vd-pill {{d.closed ? 'vd-pill--off' : 'vd-pill--on'}}">{{d.statusText}}</text>
        <text class="vd-cd {{d.closed ? 'vd-cd--off' : ''}}">{{d.countdownText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="vd-title">{{d.title}}</view>
      <view class="vd-sub">{{d.ownerText}} · {{d.modeText}} · {{d.deadlineText}}</view>
      <view class="vd-desc" wx:if="{{d.desc}}">{{d.desc}}</view>
      <view class="vd-tags">
        <text class="vd-tag" wx:for="{{d.tags}}" wx:key="key">{{item.text}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="vd-stats">
        <view class="vd-stat">
          <view class="vd-stat-v">{{d.total}}</view>
          <view class="vd-stat-l">已投人数</view>
        </view>
        <view class="vd-stat">
          <view class="vd-stat-v">{{d.hasVoted ? '已投' : '未投'}}</view>
          <view class="vd-stat-l">我的状态</view>
        </view>
        <view class="vd-stat">
          <view class="vd-stat-v">{{d.resultsHidden ? '隐藏' : '公开'}}</view>
          <view class="vd-stat-l">结果</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 分享入口（2026-11-19）：标题=投票标题、path=本详情 ?id=；卡片/长图都不展示投票结果 -->
    <view class="vd-sharebar">
      <view class="share-btn" bindtap="openShare" hover-class="share-btn--tap">分享投票</view>
      <text class="vd-share-hint">分享卡片和长图均不显示结果，点开小程序查看</text>
    </view>

    <!-- 结果隐藏提示 -->
    <view class="vd-hide" wx:if="{{d.resultsHidden}}">{{d.hiddenTip}}</view>

    <!-- 选项：可勾选（单选圆 / 多选方），结果可见时显示百分比条与人数 -->
    <view class="vd-card">
      <view class="vd-card-t">选项</view>
      <view class="vd-opt {{item.selected ? 'vd-opt--on' : ''}} {{d.canVote ? 'vd-opt--tap' : ''}}"
            wx:for="{{d.options}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="pickOption">
        <view class="vd-box {{d.settings.multi ? 'vd-box--multi' : ''}} {{item.selected ? 'vd-box--on' : ''}}">
          <text wx:if="{{item.selected}}" class="vd-box-t">✓</text>
        </view>
        <view class="vd-opt-main">
          <view class="vd-opt-t">{{item.text}}</view>
          <view class="vd-opt-d" wx:if="{{item.desc}}">{{item.desc}}</view>
          <image class="vd-opt-img" wx:if="{{item.img}}" src="{{item.img}}" mode="aspectFill"></image>
          <view class="vd-bar" wx:if="{{item.showBar}}">
            <view class="vd-bar-in" style="width: {{item.pct}}%"></view>
          </view>
        </view>
        <view class="vd-opt-n" wx:if="{{item.showBar}}">
          <text class="vd-opt-pct">{{item.pct}}%</text>
          <text class="vd-opt-cnt">{{item.count}} 票</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 实名投票人（仅实名 && 结果可见；匿名投票不渲染） -->
    <view class="vd-card" wx:if="{{d.voters.length}}">
      <view class="vd-card-t">{{d.votersTitle}}</view>
      <view class="vd-voter" wx:for="{{d.voters}}" wx:key="name">
        <text class="vd-voter-n">{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="vd-voter-c">{{item.text}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <!-- 管理（发起人 / 管理员；编辑仅无票时） -->
    <view class="vd-card" wx:if="{{d.canManage}}">
      <view class="vd-card-t">管理</view>
      <view class="vd-mbtns">
        <view class="vd-mbtn" wx:if="{{d.canEdit}}" bindtap="manageEdit">编辑</view>
        <view class="vd-mbtn" wx:if="{{d.canClose}}" bindtap="manageClose">提前结束</view>
        <view class="vd-mbtn" bindtap="openExtend">{{d.extendLabel}}</view>
        <view class="vd-mbtn vd-mbtn--danger" bindtap="manageDelete">删除</view>
      </view>
      <view class="vd-manage-hint" wx:if="{{!d.canEdit && d.total > 0}}">已有投票后不可编辑标题与选项</view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <!-- 提交 / 改票操作条 -->
  <block wx:if="{{d && d.canVote}}">
    <view class="actionbar">
      <view class="actionbar__inner">
        <text class="vd-sel">已选 {{choices.length}} 项</text>
        <view class="m3-btn m3-btn--filled grow {{submitting ? 'm3-btn--disabled' : ''}}" bindtap="submitVote">{{submitting ? '提交中…' : d.submitText}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <!-- 5:4 分享卡画布 + 图片分享长图画布（离屏；详情渲染后异步生成，失败回退 images/share/default.png） -->
  <canvas type="2d" id="card" class="exp-canvas"></canvas>
  <canvas type="2d" id="shareCanvas" class="share-canvas"></canvas>

  <share-sheet show="{{shareSheet}}" preview="{{shareImg}}" preview-alt="{{sharePoster}}"
               title-text="{{shareTitle}}" busy="{{shareBusy}}" hint="{{shareHint}}"
               bind:close="closeShare" bind:image="shareImage" />

  <!-- ============ 延长 / 重开弹层 ============ -->
  <block wx:if="{{extendOpen}}">
    <view class="sheet-mask" bindtap="closeExtend"></view>
    <view class="sheet vd-sheet" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="sheet__grabber"></view>
      <view class="vd-sheet-hd">
        <text class="vd-sheet-t">{{d && d.closed ? '重开投票' : '延长截止'}}</text>
        <view class="vd-sheet-x" bindtap="closeExtend" aria-role="button" aria-label="关闭">×</view>
      </view>
      <view class="vd-sheet-label">从现在起</view>
      <view class="vd-quicks">
        <view class="vd-quick {{extQuick === item ? 'vd-quick--on' : ''}}" wx:for="{{extQuickOpts}}" wx:key="*this"
              data-min="{{item}}" bindtap="pickExtQuick">+{{item}} 分钟</view>
      </view>
      <view class="vd-sheet-label">或指定截止日期时间</view>
      <view class="vd-dt">
        <picker mode="date" value="{{extDate}}" bindchange="onExtDate">
          <view class="vd-dt-btn">{{extDate || '选择日期'}}</view>
        </picker>
        <picker mode="time" value="{{extTime}}" bindchange="onExtTime">
          <view class="vd-dt-btn">{{extTime || '选择时间'}}</view>
        </picker>
      </view>
      <view class="vd-sheet-ft">
        <view class="m3-btn m3-btn--text" bindtap="closeExtend">取消</view>
        <view class="grow"></view>
        <view class="m3-btn m3-btn--filled" bindtap="confirmExtend">确定</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
